{"term": {"label": "義", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "4B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/li-lou-ii", "title": "離婁下", "description": "孟子曰：「舜生於諸馮，遷於負夏，卒於鳴條，東夷之人也。文王生於岐周，卒於畢郢，西夷之人也。地之相去也，千有餘里；世之相後也，千有餘歲。得志行乎中國，若合符節。先聖後聖，其揆一也。」\n子產聽鄭國之政，以其乘輿濟人於溱洧。孟子曰：「惠而不知為政。歲十一月徒杠成，十二月輿梁成，民未病涉也。君子平其政，行辟人可也。焉得人人而濟", "occurrences": 8, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "事", "id": "事"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "傷", "id": "傷"}, {"form": "取", "id": "取"}, {"form": "君", "id": "君"}, {"form": "存", "id": "存"}, {"form": "心", "id": "心"}, {"form": "愛", "id": "愛"}, {"form": "智", "id": "智"}, {"form": "水", "id": "水"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "聽", "id": "聽"}, {"form": "臣", "id": "臣"}, {"form": "行", "id": "行"}, {"form": "視", "id": "視"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.7979133348024332, "source": "行", "target": "聽"}, {"weight": 1.7979133348024332, "source": "行", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.9802348915963879, "source": "行", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 1.9802348915963879, "source": "行", "target": "智"}, {"weight": 2.4910605153623786, "source": "行", "target": "水"}, {"weight": 2.4910605153623786, "source": "行", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 1.5102312623506524, "source": "行", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 1.692552819144607, "source": "事", "target": "君"}, {"weight": 2.8965256234705428, "source": "事", "target": "水"}, {"weight": 2.3856999997045523, "source": "事", "target": "智"}, {"weight": 0.9994056385846617, "source": "仁", "target": "君"}, {"weight": 2.3856999997045523, "source": "仁", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 1.9156963704588168, "source": "仁", "target": "存"}, {"weight": 1.692552819144607, "source": "仁", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 2.608843551018762, "source": "仁", "target": "愛"}, {"weight": 1.7615456906315583, "source": "傷", "target": "視"}, {"weight": 2.608843551018762, "source": "傷", "target": "取"}, {"weight": 2.791165107812717, "source": "君", "target": "臣"}, {"weight": 2.6370144279854584, "source": "君", "ta